# Too Many Chefs (bastok 86), the quest's own var at the completion: Bastok fame 325, accepted, TOO_MANY_CHEFS 5 and
# Quest[1][86]Prog 1 (GMs). Umberto (the second talk of a pair: his default 411 first): 473; finished: Aileen's Delight,
# ITEM_OBTAINED, Bastok fame +50, TOO_MANY_CHEFS 0, the raw player:completeQuest. The raw completeQuest does no cleanup:
# Quest[1][86]Prog stays 1 (quest:complete's cleanup would clear it).
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-57,-4,-134
fame Bastok 325
quest Bastok.TooManyChefs accepted
charvar TOO_MANY_CHEFS 5
charvar Quest[1][86]Prog 1      # a GM: the quest's own var
login
trigger Umberto                 # default turn: 411
finish
trigger Umberto                 # script: 473
finish                          # Aileen's Delight, 50 fame, the var 0, completed, Prog kept
